      "detail": "Collect your purchase bill of Rs. 32,000 and the photos showing the error on the washing machine screen. Check the bill to see if it states a specific return or replacement policy limit. You currently lack a written service report or written refusal from BrightHome Appliances, so keep a written record of all future communication."
